00:46:42,765 --> 00:46:47,165
“あなたに出会えてよかった”なんて
Saying "I'm so glad I met you,"

431
00:46:47,665 --> 00:46:52,665
どうでもいいほど 当たり前でさ
is so obvious it almost goes without saying,

432
00:46:53,165 --> 00:46:57,665
だけどね 言わなきゃね 死んじゃうから僕らは
but still, we have to say it, or else we'd perish.

433
00:46:58,165 --> 00:47:00,665
ありがとうね 愛してる
Thank you, I love you.

434
00:47:04,765 --> 00:47:06,165
この声も
Even this voice,

435
00:47:06,465 --> 00:47:07,865
この顔も
even this face,

436
00:47:08,165 --> 00:47:09,665
この夢も
even this dream,

437
00:47:09,965 --> 00:47:11,665
この日々も
even these days,

438
00:47:11,865 --> 00:47:13,865
この過去も
even this past,

439
00:47:14,165 --> 00:47:16,165
この道も
even this path,

440
00:47:16,665 --> 00:47:19,665
悲しさも
even the sadness...

441
00:47:20,165 --> 00:47:25,165
ひとりじゃ ひとりじゃ
is not alone, not alone.

442
00:47:26,165 --> 00:47:27,865
この歌も
Even this song,

443
00:47:28,165 --> 00:47:29,865
この夜も
even this night,

444
00:47:30,165 --> 00:47:32,165
この愛も
even this love,

445
00:47:32,665 --> 00:47:35,665
戸惑いも
even the bewilderment...

446
00:47:36,765 --> 00:47:40,665
これからも あなたがいて
From now on too, with you here

447
00:47:40,865 --> 00:47:45,165
僕がいて
and me here,

448
00:47:45,465 --> 00:47:47,165
意味を持つ
it all has meaning.

449
00:47:48,165 --> 00:47:50,665
ありがとう 分け合ってくれて ありがとう
Thank you for sharing it with me, thank you.

450
00:47:50,865 --> 00:47:54,165
約束をくれて ありがとう
Thank you for making promises with me.

451
00:47:54,465 --> 00:47:57,665
虚しさをくれて ありがとう
Thank you for giving me emptiness.

452
00:47:58,665 --> 00:48:01,665
ありがとう 理屈など超えて ありがとう
Thank you, going beyond reason, thank you.

453
00:48:01,865 --> 00:48:04,665
極論をくれて ありがとう
Thank you for giving me extremes.

454
00:48:04,865 --> 00:48:07,865
大切をくれて ありがとう
Thank you for giving me what's precious.

455
00:48:08,665 --> 00:48:10,665
この声も
Even this voice,

456
00:48:10,865 --> 00:48:12,665
この顔も
even this face,

457
00:48:12,865 --> 00:48:14,665
この夢も
even this dream,

458
00:48:14,865 --> 00:48:16,665
この日々も
even these days,

459
00:48:16,865 --> 00:48:18,665
この過去も
even this past,

460
00:48:18,865 --> 00:48:22,665
この道も 喜びも
even this path, even the joy...

461
00:48:23,165 --> 00:48:28,665
ひとりじゃ ひとりじゃ
is not alone, not alone.

462
00:48:30,165 --> 00:48:32,165
この歌も
Even this song,

463
00:48:32,365 --> 00:48:34,465
この夜も
even this night,

464
00:48:34,665 --> 00:48:37,165
この愛も 戸惑いも
even this love, even the bewilderment...

465
00:48:41,665 --> 00:48:44,865
これからも あなたがいて
From now on too, with you here

466
00:48:44,865 --> 00:48:47,665
僕がいて
and me here,

467
00:48:48,665 --> 00:48:52,165
生きていく
we will live on.

468
00:49:13,665 --> 00:49:18,165
何度も何度も “ありがとう”を
Saying "Thank you" over and over again...

469
00:49:18,665 --> 00:49:23,165
忘れて 忘れて 見失って
Forgetting, forgetting, losing sight...

470
00:49:23,665 --> 00:49:28,665
失して 悔やんで また気付いて
Losing, regretting, and realizing once again...

471
00:49:29,165 --> 00:49:34,165
何度もあなたを 思い出して
remembering you time and time again.

472
00:49:34,665 --> 00:49:39,665
変わっていく生活 重ねる歳
Changing lives, growing older.

473
00:49:40,165 --> 00:49:44,665
変わっていく自分と 変わる今と
The changing self, the changing present.

474
00:49:45,165 --> 00:49:52,665
それでも あの日と同じ距離の 声の 愛の
Yet, at the same distance as that day, with that voice, with that love...

475
00:49:52,865 --> 00:49:59,665
あなたがいること わかったよ
I realized that you are here.

476
00:50:00,665 --> 00:50:03,665
ありがとう ありがとう
Thank you, thank you.

477
00:50:05,893 --> 00:50:10,253
あなたの願いと 祈りと 迷いと
Your wishes, prayers, hesitations,

478
00:50:10,773 --> 00:50:14,293
孤独と 夢と 明日と
loneliness, dreams, tomorrow,

479
00:50:14,633 --> 00:50:20,393
僕も共に生きるよ あなたがその想いをくれたんだよ
I'll live alongside them too, because you gave me those feelings.

480
00:50:36,696 --> 00:50:40,536
「あなたに会えてよかった」なんて
Saying "I'm so glad I met you"

481
00:50:41,636 --> 00:50:46,036
どうでもいいほど 当たり前でさ
is so obvious it doesn't even need to be said,

482
00:50:46,816 --> 00:50:52,056
だけどね 言わなきゃね 死んじゃうから僕らは
but still, we have to say it, or we'll perish,

483
00:50:52,456 --> 00:50:55,956
ありがとうね あいしてる
Thank you, I love you.

484
00:51:01,396 --> 00:51:04,416
ありがとう
Thank you.

485
00:51:29,501 --> 00:51:31,921
ライブの途中ですが、じゃーん！
We're in the middle of the live, but tada!

486
00:51:32,181 --> 00:51:35,751
グッズ紹介担当のホワイトフブニャんだにゃん！
It's me, White Fubunya, in charge of goods introductions!

487
00:51:36,001 --> 00:51:40,471
韓国から収録とか意味わかんないけど、まあ、しごできなところ見せちゃおっかな！
Recording from Korea makes no sense, but whatever, I'll show you how competent I am!

488
00:51:40,871 --> 00:51:47,761
緊張しすぎてMCで喋ることほぼ喋れてない、かわいいそうなフブニャに変わってお知らせです！
Since I'm too nervous to say almost anything in my MC, I'm taking over as the pitiful Fubunya to make an announcement!

489
00:51:48,021 --> 00:51:54,751
今年もございます！2023年誕生日記念グッズ！フブニャのためにいっぱい買ってね！
It's here again this year! 2023 Birthday Commemorative Goods! Buy lots for Fubunya!

490
00:51:55,621 --> 00:51:59,351
まずはこちら！みんなでだらだらアクリルジオラスタンド！
First up! Everyone's Relaxing Acrylic Diorama Stand!

491
00:51:59,571 --> 00:52:02,551
イラストはリいちゅさんが担当してくれました！
The illustration was done by Riichu-san!

492
00:52:02,751 --> 00:52:12,091
こういうジオラマって、キャラクターと背景の間にポストカードとかチェキとか挟んで立てかけられたり、インテリアとしても使えるんじゃないかな？
With a diorama like this, can't you sandwich postcards or chekis between the character and background and display it, or use it as interior decor?

493
00:52:12,401 --> 00:52:15,191
あれれ、もしかしてフブニャ天才じゃん！
Wait, could Fubunya be a genius?!

494
00:52:15,341 --> 00:52:19,151
新小のお部屋スタイルでだらだらなデザインとなってます！
It's designed with the Shinsho room style for a relaxed look!

495
00:52:19,871 --> 00:52:22,111
続いては、バックステージパスケース！
Next is the backstage pass case!

496
00:52:22,571 --> 00:52:26,521
ライブをお手伝いしてくれるスタッフすこん部君になれちゃうぞい！
You can become Staff Sukonbu-kun who helps out at the live!

497
00:52:26,721 --> 00:52:31,221
イベントなので名刺として使うもよし、お仕事なのでも使える人は使ってね！
Since it's an event, it's great for business cards, or if you can use it for work, go ahead!

498
00:52:31,641 --> 00:52:34,971
フブニャも担当君にプレゼントしちゃおうかな？
Should I gift one to Tanto-kun too?

499
00:52:35,021 --> 00:52:37,421
名前はもちろんフブニャのに付ける！
Of course, I'll name it Fubunya's!

500
00:52:38,021 --> 00:52:41,311
すこん部君のお耳の再現もすごいね！
Sukonbu-kun's ears recreation is amazing too!

501
00:52:41,561 --> 00:52:48,951
裏面はなんか、前にフブニャがみんなと話し合ってこういうのいいねっていうのを取り入れたんだって！
The back apparently incorporates an idea Fubunya discussed with everyone before!

502
00:52:49,171 --> 00:52:53,011
しごできじゃん、えらぴっぴ！洋服衣装のスカートにあるデザインがカプセルに入ってるよ！
So competent, good job! The design from the casual outfit skirt is inside the capsule!

503
00:52:53,551 --> 00:52:58,051
続いて、ランダムラバーキーホルダー！イラストはヤナナンさんが担当！
Next, random rubber keychain! Illustrated by Yananan-san!

504
00:52:58,521 --> 00:53:03,301
超絶最高のラバーキーホルダー！構築てぶにゃんこれ大好き！
An ultra-awesome rubber keychain! Kouchiku Tebunyan loves this!

505
00:53:04,071 --> 00:53:14,591
通常衣装、部屋着衣装、洋服衣装にふぶらコスプレのラバーキーホルダー！オタク君のカバンにつけるもよし、さっきのバックステージパスにつけるのもいいかも！
Normal outfit, loungewear outfit, casual outfit, and Fubura cosplay rubber keychain! Great for attaching to an otaku's bag or the backstage pass!

506
00:53:14,591 --> 00:53:21,571
ちなみに汚れたラバーキーホルダーにはジョコ液を綿棒につけてこするといいらしいって聞いたんだけど、ガチ？
By the way, I heard rubbing dirty rubber keychains with kitchen cleanser on a cotton swab works, is that for real?

507
00:53:21,751 --> 00:53:24,661
最後はまさかのフブキの部屋着ジャージ！
Lastly, Fubuki's loungewear jersey!

508
00:53:24,821 --> 00:53:27,241
部屋着フブニャも欲しい！
Loungewear Fubunya wants one too!

509
00:53:27,481 --> 00:53:31,221
男女兼用サイズだから担当君にも着せられちゃうね！
It's unisex size so you can make Tanto-kun wear it too!

510
00:53:31,531 --> 00:53:36,011
普段着使いしやすいシンプルなデザインだし、これまで出したTシャツにも合うんじゃないかな？
It's a simple design easy for everyday wear, and it should match the T-shirts released so far!

511
00:53:36,251 --> 00:53:41,091
オタク君たちのジャージ姿、フブニャも見てみたいよ！
I'd love to see otaku-kun's jersey looks too!

512
00:53:41,331 --> 00:53:43,671
ねぇ、おそろっちにしようよ！
Hey, let's match!

513
00:53:43,821 --> 00:53:46,041
は？ 今やだって言った？
Huh? Did you just say no?

514
00:53:47,021 --> 00:53:52,771
そして今回もございます！数量限定フルセット購入特典直筆サイン入り！
And we also have this! Quantity-limited full set purchase bonus with handwritten signature!

515
00:53:53,011 --> 00:53:57,161
今回は初のチェキ風ブロマイドカード！
This time, it's our first cheki-style bromide card!

516
00:53:57,161 --> 00:54:04,581
ってこれ、願うふにゃふにゃで超絶アイドルのお寝起き顔が激写ってこと？究極の宝じゃん！
Wait, does this mean an ultra-desirable, super-cute idol's just-woken-up face is captured? It's the ultimate treasure!

517
00:54:04,581 --> 00:54:08,161
まあ、フブニャはこういう願うとか絶対見せないけどね！
Well, Fubunya would never show such wishing faces!

518
00:54:08,781 --> 00:54:15,911
以上、今年の誕生日グッズのご紹介でした！引き続きライブをお楽しみになってくださいね！
That concludes the introduction of this year's birthday goods! Please continue enjoying the live!

519
00:54:41,696 --> 00:54:44,556
もうすぐ時計は6時
Soon the clock will strike 6

520
00:54:45,136 --> 00:54:48,296
もうそこに一番星
The first star is already there

521
00:54:48,936 --> 00:54:53,456
影を踏んで 夜に紛れたくなる 帰り道
Stepping on my shadows, on my way home wanting to blend into the night

522
00:54:57,236 --> 00:55:00,016
どんなに探してみても
No matter how much I search

523
00:55:00,921 --> 00:55:04,281
どんなに探してみても 一つしかない星
No matter how hard I search, there's only one star.

524
00:55:05,501 --> 00:55:09,351
何億光年 離れたところから
From somewhere billions of light-years away...

525
00:55:09,921 --> 00:55:14,001
あんなに輝く
Shining so brightly,

526
00:55:14,421 --> 00:55:17,691
いいな 君は みんなから愛されて
you're so lucky, loved by everyone.

527
00:55:22,641 --> 00:55:23,191
「いいや 僕は ずっと一人きりさ」
"Well, I've always been all alone."

528
00:55:29,931 --> 00:55:30,631
君と集まって 星座になれたら
If we gather together and become a constellation...

529
00:55:34,671 --> 00:55:38,291
星降る夜 一瞬の願い事
A falling star, a fleeting wish.

530
00:55:39,091 --> 00:55:45,611
きらめいて ゆらめいて 震えてるシグナル
Sparkling, flickering, trembling signals.

531
00:55:50,571 --> 00:55:53,721
空見上げて 指を差されるような
Like pointing up at the sky,

532
00:55:54,401 --> 00:56:02,171
つないだ線 解かないで
never untie this connected line.

533
00:55:57,861 --> 00:56:05,021
僕がどんなに眩しくても
No matter how dazzling I might be...

534
00:56:09,968 --> 00:56:10,818
もうすぐ時計は８時
It's almost 8 o'clock.

535
00:56:13,518 --> 00:56:16,348
夜空に満天の星
The night sky is filled with stars.

536
00:56:17,528 --> 00:56:24,748
何億光年 離れたところにはもうないかもしれない
That distant place might no longer exist.

537
00:56:26,948 --> 00:56:33,198
月が綺麗で 泣きそうになるのは
The moon is so pretty, it makes me want to cry.

538
00:56:34,638 --> 00:56:41,338
いつの日か 別れが来るから
Because one day, a parting will come.

539
00:56:42,018 --> 00:56:45,708
君と集まって 星座になれたら
If we gather together and become a constellation...

540
00:56:46,718 --> 00:56:50,328
流星みたい 流れるひとりごと
A monologue flowing like a meteor.

541
00:56:50,848 --> 00:56:57,988
消えていく 残像は 真夜中のプリズム
The fading afterimage is a midnight prism.

542
00:56:58,648 --> 00:57:05,548
切なる願い 誰かに届いたら
If our earnest wishes reach someone...

543
00:57:06,608 --> 00:57:14,308
変わるかな 夜の淵をなぞるような こんな僕でも
Can I change, tracing the abyss of the night, even a nobody like me?

544
00:57:29,868 --> 00:57:33,168
遥か彼方 僕らは出会ってしまった
We met far, far away.

545
00:57:37,218 --> 00:57:42,968
カルマだから 何度も出会ってしまうよ
That's why we'll cross paths again and again.

546
00:57:44,708 --> 00:57:47,788
雲の隙間で
Through the gaps in the clouds.

547
00:57:49,228 --> 00:57:55,468
君と集まって 星座になれたら 夜広げて描こう絵空事を
If we gather together and become a constellation, let's paint an impossible dream across the night.

548
00:57:58,058 --> 00:58:04,748
暗闇を照らすような満月じゃなくても
Even if it's not a full moon illuminating the darkness,

549
00:58:05,268 --> 00:58:13,228
だから集まって星座になりたい 色とりどりの光 放ような
That's why I want us to gather and become a constellation, radiating colorful lights.

550
00:58:14,228 --> 00:58:17,688
つないだ線 解かないよ
Never untie this connected line,

551
00:58:17,928 --> 00:58:22,858
君がどんなに眩しくても
no matter how dazzling you are.

552
00:59:03,824 --> 00:59:07,464
平穏すぎて くだらない世界
In a mundane and boring world,

553
00:59:08,214 --> 00:59:12,994
閉ざしてた 誰も信じずに
not trusting anyone and keeping it closed,

554
00:59:13,624 --> 00:59:17,434
こじ開けたんだ 君が突然に
you suddenly pried it open.

555
00:59:18,454 --> 00:59:26,594
あのまなざしが僕を救った 初めて触れる感情
That gaze saved me, touching my emotions for the very first time.

556
00:59:27,344 --> 00:59:31,734
消えないように 握りしめて
Holding on tightly so it won't fade away,

557
00:59:31,824 --> 00:59:41,204
繋がる心の声 まだ見ぬ世界へと
headed toward a yet-unseen world on the voice of our connected hearts.

558
00:59:41,934 --> 00:59:50,594
瞳に映っている 眩しすぎる今が 嘘だとしても構わない
Reflected in my eyes, even if the dazzling present is a lie, I don't care.

559
00:59:54,774 --> 01:00:02,174
響き続けた声を追って いつしかここが居場所になって
Chasing the voice that kept echoing, finding a place where this finally belongs.

560
01:00:02,695 --> 01:00:05,175
平穏すぎて くだらない世界
A world too peaceful and mundane,

561
01:00:05,175 --> 01:00:06,095
(全てが)
(everything)

562
01:00:06,425 --> 01:00:08,755
閉ざしてた 誰も信じずに
I had closed off, trusting no one,

563
01:00:08,755 --> 01:00:11,495
こじ開けたんだ 君が突然に
Until you suddenly forced it open

564
01:00:11,495 --> 01:00:12,425
(手を引く)
(taking my hand).

565
01:00:12,525 --> 01:00:17,045
あの眼差しが 僕を救った
That gaze of yours saved me.

566
01:00:17,685 --> 01:00:20,225
初めて触れる感情
Emotions I felt for the very first time

567
01:00:20,225 --> 01:00:21,095
(あふれる)
(overflowing)

568
01:00:21,095 --> 01:00:22,655
消えないように
So they wouldn't fade away,

569
01:00:22,655 --> 01:00:24,395
握りしめて
I held them tight.

570
01:00:24,395 --> 01:00:27,025
繋ぐ 心の声
Connecting voices of the heart

571
01:00:27,025 --> 01:00:27,895
(ここにいるよ)
("I'm right here"),

572
01:00:28,025 --> 01:00:30,385
まだ見ぬ世界へと
Toward a world yet unseen

573
01:00:30,385 --> 01:00:31,095
(導く)
(guiding me).

574
01:00:31,095 --> 01:00:33,395
瞳に映っている 眩しすぎる今が
The present reflected in my eyes is so dazzling,

575
01:00:33,395 --> 01:00:34,425
嘘でも構わない
Even if it's a lie, I don't care

576
01:00:34,425 --> 01:00:35,125
(幻でも)
(even if it's an illusion).

577
01:00:47,889 --> 01:00:50,909
揺れる 心の声
A swaying voice of the heart,

578
01:00:50,909 --> 01:00:55,029
溢れ出す 想いも
and overflowing feelings—

579
01:00:55,029 --> 01:00:59,799
時が過ぎるだけで 忘れてゆくなんて
that they would simply be forgotten as time passes...

580
01:00:59,799 --> 01:01:03,789
どうしても悔しくて
I couldn't help but feel frustrated by it.

581
01:01:03,929 --> 01:01:08,319
深い 僕の心まで (届いている)
Deep into my heart (it reaches)

582
01:01:08,319 --> 01:01:12,259
名前を呼ぶ声が (聞こえる)
The voice calling my name (I can hear it).

583
01:01:12,259 --> 01:01:17,069
いつまでも続くなんて あり得ないとわかっていたけど
Even though I knew it could never last forever

584
01:01:17,069 --> 01:01:18,119
(一瞬だって)
(even for just a moment)

585
01:01:18,119 --> 01:01:20,639
遠ざかる 景色の中
Amidst the receding scenery,

586
01:01:20,639 --> 01:01:23,709
また夢を見ていた
I was dreaming once again.

587
01:01:51,457 --> 01:01:56,977
はーい、ということで「ブルージャーニー」より歌方をお聞きいただきました。ありがとうございます！
Alright! So that was "Utakata" from Blue Journey. Thank you very much!

588
01:01:56,977 --> 01:02:00,697
そして「ブルージャーニー」以上でございまーす！
And that concludes the Blue Journey portion!

589
01:02:00,697 --> 01:02:09,177
いやもう本当にこの衣装、めちゃめちゃ可愛いので、こうやってちゃんと新しいお召し姿でのお披露目もできて嬉しいです！
Man, this outfit is seriously super cute, so I'm so happy I could debut it in this brand new look!

590
01:02:09,177 --> 01:02:17,187
ってさっきブルー・ジャーニーの楽曲もね、ライブをね見に来てくれた方だとね、ふと二人足りないんじゃないかなと思うんですけども
And you know, for those of you who came to see the Blue Journey live, you might be thinking, "Aren't two people missing?"

591
01:02:17,187 --> 01:02:28,437
実は この曲「あの日は、何度…」「あの日の君へ」とルミネと3人で歌っておりますので、あのまだね、あの歌方結局聴いてないよって方は是非とも聴いていただけると嬉しいです！
Actually, we sang this song—along with "Ano Hi wa Nando..." and "Ano Hi no Kimi e"—with the three of us at Lumine. So if you haven't listened to Utakata yet, I'd really love for you to check it out!

592
01:02:28,437 --> 01:02:38,417
さてさて、まあね、こちらの楽曲、まあ結構ね切ない感じの楽曲 なんですけども、
Now, as for this song, well, it's a pretty bittersweet kind of song,

593
01:02:38,417 --> 01:02:51,847
まあなんかそういう気持ちの時もみんなあるよねみたいな、えー曲でちょっとしんみりしつつも、また夢を見ていたというね夢オチとなんとも言えない悲しいような寂しいような曲となっておりました が、
but you know, we all have times when we feel that way, right? It's a song that's a bit somber, yet has that "it was all a dream" kind of ending—a rather sad and lonely sort of track.

594
01:02:51,847 --> 01:02:57,257
皆さんの心にちょっとでも響いてくれたらいいなと思い選曲しました！
But I chose it hoping it would resonate even just a little bit in everyone's hearts!

595
01:02:57,257 --> 01:03:09,987
さて、ついに次で最後の曲でーす！ 最後の曲はなんと白上フブキオリジナル楽曲となっております、新曲です！
And now, finally, it's the last song! And the final song is none other than Shirakami Fubuki's original song—a brand new track!

596
01:03:09,987 --> 01:03:24,667
こちらの楽曲歌ったあとはもうねすぐバイバイになってしまうので、ちょっとこの楽曲は、まあね結構白上織曲では白上からみんなに伝えたいみたいな感じだったんですけども
After singing this song, we'll be saying goodbye right away, so... while this song—well, in my previous original songs, it felt like I wanted to convey something from myself to everyone,

597
01:03:24,667 --> 01:03:42,737
今回の新曲は、結構ファム目線の楽曲となっておりますので、なんかみんなもこういう気持ちでだったらいいなとか、白上はなんかこういう気持ちで推しのこと見てるよっていう、
but this new song is written very much from the fan's perspective. So I hope everyone can feel this way too, or feel like, "This is the feeling with which I'm watching my oshi."

598
01:03:42,737 --> 01:03:46,297
カスタとなっておりますので、なんか共感していっぱい歌ってくれたらいいなと思っております！
It's customized that way, so I hope you can resonate with it and sing along a lot!

599
01:03:46,297 --> 01:03:54,847
では、いきますかね？ じゃあ最後の楽曲白上フブキオリジナル楽曲聞いてください。「レター」
Well, shall we go? Alright, please listen to the final track, Shirakami Fubuki's original song: "Letter."

600
01:04:13,390 --> 01:04:17,470
Dear My Fave, 「ありがとう」を込めて
Dear My Fave, with "Thank you" poured inside,

601
01:04:17,470 --> 01:04:22,030
キミの名は かけがえのない光
Your name is an irreplaceable light.

602
01:04:31,649 --> 01:04:33,829
リアルだって 頑張れる！
Even in reality, I can do my best!

603
01:04:33,829 --> 01:04:37,629
だって、言葉ひとつで胸が躍る
Because a single word makes my heart leap.

604
01:04:37,629 --> 01:04:40,069
“限界”と呼ばれたっていい
It's fine if they call it my "limit,"

605
01:04:40,069 --> 01:04:41,689
生きる理由なんです
It's the reason I live.

606
01:04:41,689 --> 01:04:44,639
へこんだって 見失ったって
Even if I feel down, even if I lose sight,

607
01:04:44,639 --> 01:04:47,279
また私を照らしてくれる
You'll light me up once again.

608
01:04:47,279 --> 01:04:50,909
心臓はしずかみされて 気絶しちゃいそうです
My heart is gripped so tightly I feel like I might faint.

609
01:04:50,909 --> 01:04:55,879
一生懸命な姿に 何度も勇気をもらったから
Because your earnest figure gave me courage time and time again,

610
01:04:55,879 --> 01:05:01,518
今度は私がエールになりたい
Now I want to be the one cheering for you.

611
01:05:01,836 --> 01:05:05,418
今度は私がエールになりたい
I want to be the one to cheer you on this time.

612
01:05:05,698 --> 01:05:08,368
挑め 全熱量の讃歌
Take on this anthem of total passion!

613
01:05:08,528 --> 01:05:10,268
Dear my fave,

614
01:05:10,628 --> 01:05:12,718
「大好き！」が溢れた
"I love you!" overflows from my heart.

615
01:05:12,718 --> 01:05:17,168
この想い、手紙に書いて贈ります
I'll write these feelings in a letter and send them to you.

616
01:05:17,998 --> 01:05:19,968
you made my day

617
01:05:19,968 --> 01:05:22,068
夢を叶えて
making my dreams come true.

618
01:05:22,368 --> 01:05:27,018
君の笑顔が、私の原動力
Your smile is my energy—

619
01:05:27,618 --> 01:05:30,518
you will always be the first star in my heart☆彡

620
01:05:30,668 --> 01:05:33,268
どこまでもついてゆくよ！
I'll follow you anywhere!

621
01:05:33,568 --> 01:05:35,318
I'm your biggest fan

622
01:05:43,718 --> 01:05:47,518
「幸せ」って 君と出会って過ごす日々だと
"Happiness" is defined as the days spent meeting you—

623
01:05:47,518 --> 01:05:49,368
定義された！
yes, it's defined!

624
01:05:49,568 --> 01:05:51,518
会えない時間だって…良い！
Even time apart is... fine!

625
01:05:51,518 --> 01:05:53,418
愛を育てるんです
We're just nurturing our love.

626
01:05:53,568 --> 01:05:56,318
どうしたって叫びたくなった
No matter what, I wanted to shout it out—

627
01:05:56,318 --> 01:05:58,518
イタズラが重の重の重っっ！！
this mischievous, overwhelming love!

628
01:05:58,618 --> 01:06:01,418
来世も来来世までも
For lives and lives to come,

629
01:06:01,418 --> 01:06:03,368
語り継ぎたいのです
I want to pass this story on.

630
01:06:03,618 --> 01:06:05,968
一瞬一瞬が
Every single moment makes

631
01:06:05,968 --> 01:06:08,368
ときめくよ
my heart flutter so.

632
01:06:08,618 --> 01:06:10,518
両手に一杯の
With memories filling

633
01:06:10,518 --> 01:06:12,568
思い出
both my hands.

634
01:06:12,768 --> 01:06:17,418
確かめ合えば寂しくないから
If we confirm it together, we won't be lonely,

635
01:06:17,568 --> 01:06:20,318
繋げ全絆の結晶
so connect this crystal of all our bonds!

636
01:06:20,518 --> 01:06:22,568
dear my fave,

637
01:06:22,768 --> 01:06:25,018
「がんばって！」なんて言えない
I can't just say "Do your best!"

638
01:06:25,018 --> 01:06:29,018
「大丈夫」の三文字で伝わるかな…
I wonder if the three letters of "It's okay" will convey it...

639
01:06:29,618 --> 01:06:31,418
day by day

640
01:06:31,418 --> 01:06:33,918
そう、君のおかげで
yeah, thanks to you,

641
01:06:34,318 --> 01:06:39,118
少しだけ、自分を好きになれたから
I've grown to like myself just a little bit more.

642
01:06:49,018 --> 01:06:53,418
君らしく keep smiling and enjoy yourself
Be yourself, keep smiling and enjoy yourself!

643
01:06:53,618 --> 01:06:58,118
心から願う 私がいる
I'm here, wishing from the bottom of my heart—

644
01:06:58,518 --> 01:07:01,518
ひとりじゃない
you're not alone!

645
01:07:03,318 --> 01:07:04,618
dear my fave,

646
01:07:04,618 --> 01:07:08,018
「大好き！」を集めた
gathering up all my "I love yous!"

647
01:07:08,368 --> 01:07:12,718
愛言葉 手紙に書いて贈ります
I'll write these words of love in a letter and send them.

648
01:07:13,368 --> 01:07:15,068
you made my life

649
01:07:15,068 --> 01:07:17,068
夢で終わらない
and it won't end as a dream.

650
01:07:17,568 --> 01:07:22,068
君だけが、君こそが起こす奇跡
You alone, yes, you are the one who creates miracles.

651
01:07:22,568 --> 01:07:25,968
you will always be the first star in my heart☆彡

652
01:07:26,368 --> 01:07:28,518
信じて夜空のようにずっと
Believing in it like the night sky forever—

653
01:07:28,518 --> 01:07:31,568
i will follow you forever

654
01:07:32,568 --> 01:07:38,018
ありったけの愛を込めて 「ありがとう」
With all the love I have: "Thank you."

655
01:07:38,368 --> 01:07:42,368
君というたった一つの奇跡
To you, my one and only miracle.

656
01:07:42,568 --> 01:07:46,568
銀河を越えて掛け合うフレーズ 輝かせて
Let our echoing phrases shine across the galaxy!

657
01:07:46,768 --> 01:07:50,518
Best wishes,

